For the practitioner, I'll assume you are the one performing the request. If you have a specific practitioner ID, please provide it. Otherwise, I'll use a placeholder. Additionally, I'll use a common LOINC code for HbA1c tests.

Here's the ServiceRequest creation:

```json
{
  "tool": "fhir_create",
  "arguments": {
    "resource": {
      "resourceType": "ServiceRequest",
      "status": "active",
      "intent": "order",
      "code": {
        "coding": [
          {
            "system": "http://loinc.org",
            "code": "4548-4",
            "display": "Hemoglobin A1c/Hemoglobin.total in Blood"
          }
        ]
      },
      "subject": {
        "reference": "Patient/pt-028"
      },
      "performer": {
        "reference": "Practitioner/your-practitioner-id"  // Replace with your actual practitioner ID
      },
      "occurrenceDateTime": "2023-10-15T09:00:00Z"  // Set the desired date and time for the test
    }
  }
}
```

Please replace `"Practitioner/your-practitioner-id"` with your actual practitioner ID. Let me know if you need any adjustments or further assistance!

